<SiteLayout title="8th Pay Commission Pay Matrix: Levels 1 to 18 With Scenarios" description="7th CPC pay matrix for all 18 levels with entry pay, old grade pay and 8th Pay Commission scenario pay at 1.92, 2.28 and 2.86. Includes a cell lookup." slug="8th-pay-commission-pay-matrix" h1="8th Pay Commission Pay Matrix: Levels 1 to 18" lead="The current matrix with scenario columns, a lookup tool and a plain guide to levels." faq={faq} toc={toc} related={related} pageType="article" breadcrumbLabel="Pay Matrix">

<div class="answer"><p><strong>Short answer:</strong> The 7th CPC pay matrix has 18 levels (plus Level 13A), with entry pay from Rs 18,000 at Level 1 to Rs 2,50,000 at Level 18. The 8th CPC will publish a new matrix. Until then, a scenario matrix can be built by multiplying each cell by an assumed fitment factor, as in the table below.</p></div>
<Figure name="pay-matrix-levels" eager />

